1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:03,290
Iron mein 3 pin, par charger mein sirf 2.

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:06,080
Kya ye shock ka khatra hai? Ek pin gayab kyun?

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:10,480
Teesra pin earth pin hai, jo metal body wali cheezon ko shock se bachata hai.

4
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,170
Poori kahani linked video mein hai.

5
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:17,760
Par charger mein taar ke upar insulation ki do parat hoti hai. Ise kehte hain double insulation.

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:21,680
Isliye current aap tak pahunchta hi nahi, aur earth pin ki zaroorat nahi.

7
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:28,640
Kai chargers ke label pe square ke andar square hota hai. Yahi iski nishaani hai, par har charger pe ho, zaroori nahi.

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:32,960
Simple rule: metal body, 3 pin. Double insulation, 2 pin.

9
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:37,450
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo!
